    "detailed_description": "<h1>Retro Tower Defense!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506050/extras/624b75a3a37c3f6ceef37d47f977ad85.avif?t=1754396542\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Fortress is a retro-inspired tower defense game packed with fast-paced real-time strategy. Build your defenses, command powerful abilities, and unleash devastating energy blasts to hold off relentless enemy waves. Can you master the battlefield?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506050/extras/1cdfb45e8351393a98a6898b5d482efc.webp?t=1754396542\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506050/extras/57cc6e9e15b221d80214fdacf2e68ec6.poster.avif?t=1754396542\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506050/extras/57cc6e9e15b221d80214fdacf2e68ec6.webm?t=1754396542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506050/extras/57cc6e9e15b221d80214fdacf2e68ec6.mp4?t=1754396542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Pixel Fortress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Fortress is a fast-paced, retro-inspired tower defense game where strategy meets action. Build defenses, deploy troops, and unleash powerful magic rays to stop relentless enemy waves. Adapt your tactics and master the battlefield in pixel-perfect style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506050/extras/e4fb9810f047fba7d2c5900cef44d153.webp?t=1754396542\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506050/extras/66b8ff46e1a6867db8e0c39a12f880bd.poster.avif?t=1754396542\" width=600 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506050/extras/66b8ff46e1a6867db8e0c39a12f880bd.webm?t=1754396542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506050/extras/66b8ff46e1a6867db8e0c39a12f880bd.mp4?t=1754396542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nostalgic pixel art and fluid gameplay, Pixel Fortress delivers intense tactical challenges. Face tougher foes, experiment with strategies, and test your skills in real-time battles. Will your fortress withstand the siege?</p>",
